  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Initiation Plan (&#x201c;IP&#x201d;) will provide incubation support for the respect for human rights in business operations in Serbia, thereby contributing towards sustainable growth and enhanced corporate responsibility, by the development of the national baseline assessment on business and human rights and development of the National Action Plan for Business and Human Rights and other policies and/or laws aimed at implementing the UNGPs. Finally, the B+HR IP will be the first of its kind in Serbia with</narrative>
